    <h2>About Yoga</h2>

    <p>
        Yoga is a good practice for our body and mind.
        It helps us to stay healthy and peaceful.
        Yoga improves our flexibility and fitness.
        Everyone can practice yoga every day.
    </p>

    <br>

    <h2>Types of Yoga</h2>

    <h3>1. Hatha Yoga</h3>

    <p>
        Hatha Yoga helps to improve body strength
        and flexibility.
    </p>

    <h3>2. Vinyasa Yoga</h3>

    <p>
        Vinyasa Yoga includes different body movements
        and breathing exercises.
    </p>

    <h3>3. Meditation</h3>

    <p>
        Meditation helps to reduce stress
        and improve concentration.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h2>Benefits of Yoga</h2>

    <p>
        1. Improves physical health.
        <br>
        2. Reduces stress.
        <br>
        3. Improves flexibility.
        <br>
        4. Helps in better sleep.
        <br>
        5. Improves concentration.
    </p>

